            "review_title": "Review at BonPas Bakery & Coffee",
            "review_text": "Minh Alan\nDa Nang, Vietnam256 contributions\n0\nBeautiful rainy day with my wife and our cake\nOct 2025 • Couples\nMy wife loves to eat cakes so I chose to come to this place Bonpas. The space is sparkling and luxurious with white and yellow lights. The scent of the cake also blends in, very fragrant. The staff are very polite, courteous and professional with a welcoming style and enthusiastic advice on dishes. Our cake is soft and tender, delicious of course. Thank you very much Bonpas for all your kindness on a rainy day for the two of us.\nRead more\nWritten November 1, 2025",
